ows a summer with a lot of prep  involved normally it will take about  say four months from casting to actually  producing the show to actually what you  see right now  but there's also probably about a year  when you actually start doing the set  design doing costumes doing uh the music  in your band together so  a year four months it's about a year's  worth of producing also a lot of  behind-the-scenes work comes solely from  gracious volunteers i don't think people  realize that it's  it's a bunch of volunteer board members  providing their time as well as all of  these volunteers in the community  providing their time  and then those people on the stage  who are also  community performers superstars both on  and off the stage this is the best kept  secret in southern nevada

